      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
      <description>&lt;h2&gt;Asteroid Squadron 1.35&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This release exercises the new Sparkle update workflow from version 1.34.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Choose &lt;strong&gt;Asteroid Squadron → Check for Updates…&lt;/strong&gt;, then install this update to verify download, installation and relaunch on your Mac.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Requires an Apple Silicon Mac running macOS 13 or newer. The app and disk image are signed and notarized.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
